            "AI agents (MCP)": [
                "Yapay zeka arac\u0131lar\u0131 (MCP)"
            ],
            "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.": [
                "Claude, Cursor veya VS Code gibi yapay zeka asistanlar\u0131n\u0131n MCP (Model Context Protocol) arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla bu sitede sizin i\u00e7in \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131na izin verin. Bir WordPress kullan\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 olarak oturum a\u00e7arlar (Claude ve ChatGPT buradan onaylanarak, di\u011ferleri bir uygulama parolas\u0131yla) ve yaln\u0131zca o kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n yapmas\u0131na izin verilen \u015feyleri yapabilirler."
            ],
            "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.": [
                "Yapay zeka arac\u0131lar\u0131 i\u00e7in WordPress 6.9 veya \u00fczeri gereklidir. Bunlar\u0131 kullanmak i\u00e7in WordPress'i g\u00fcncelleyin."
            ],
            "Allow AI agents (MCP)": [
                "Yapay zeka arac\u0131lar\u0131na (MCP) izin verin"
            ],
            "Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.": [
                "Kapal\u0131: A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki ara\u00e7lar ve bunlar\u0131n REST yollar\u0131 hi\u00e7bir \u015fekilde kay\u0131tl\u0131 de\u011fildir."
